DESCRIPTION:Have yourself an a cappella big Christmas! The 11-member vocal
  ensemble VOCTAVE has been bringing soaring harmonies to favorites from th
 e Disney catalog to the Broadway stage for more than a decade. Now\, they
 ’re ready to “sleigh” the holiday season! An a cappella sensation\, 
 the group has enjoyed over 170 million social media views of their videos
 \, appearing on countless recordings. Their electrifying holiday spectacul
 ar – “We Need a Little Christmas” – is sure to strike a festive ch
 ord\, with a stocking full of holiday favorites. Get ready to deck the hal
 ls with harmony as VOCTAVE brings their signature sound of the season to S
 CADshow. Expect a fa-la-la-la-fabulous evening of music the whole \nCatego
 ry: Music\nOriginal listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/scadshow-presen
 ts-voctave-we-need-a-little-christmas/
